ANTOWN, W.Va. – Two of the top rushing teams in the Big 12 Conference will meet Saturday afternoon at high noon when West Virginia faces Cincinnati in a Homecoming contest at Milan Puskar Stadium.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/14/Hawkins-Practice_0LZql.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/14/Hawkins-Practice_0LZql.jpg"><media:title>Quarterback Michael Hawkins Jr. runs the football during practice on the Steve Antoline Family Practice Facility on Tuesday, October. 13, as West Virginia prepares to face Cincinnati on Saturday in Milan Puskar Stadium.</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/14/Hawkins-Practice_0LZql.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 11:58:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>2</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59539</s:story_id></item><item><title>Renewal by Andersen Joins Mountaineer Family as Official Partner of WVU Athletics</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/14/general-renewal-by-andersen-joins-mountaineer-family-as-official-partner-of-wvu-athletics</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/14/general-renewal-by-andersen-joins-mountaineer-family-as-official-partner-of-wvu-athletics</guid><category>General</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="WVU Athletics has announced a partnership with Renewal by Anderson" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/14/WVU_x_RbA_16x9__1_.png" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W. Va. – West Virginia Athletics and Renewal by Andersen, the full-service window and door replacement division of Andersen Corporation, announced today a new relationship naming the company as an Official Partner of WVU